{"4240800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Liv", "steam_appid": 4240800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you are, your task is to solve the case of a missing woman, a young and prominent food blogger. Work on this computer, you have access to her videos from the last few months, her diary, and the entire police database. Use dedicated software, solve puzzles, and immerse yourself in the murky world of mystery, brain teasers, and contradictions. Remember that you are the prime suspect. If you don't want to come to a grim end, don't disappoint me. Find out what happened to Livia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240800/extras/b2bd14e728fc4c837a4700cde52b7695.poster.avif?t=1779749095\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240800/extras/b2bd14e728fc4c837a4700cde52b7695.webm?t=1779749095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through this computer, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate:</strong> Solve this case. Your salvation depends on it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch various videos of her life:</strong>  to watch them in order, use the program I created, a system for pre-cataloging evidence and creating logical paths, but be careful not to let yourself be influenced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Read the diary and documents on the case:</strong> the truth is hidden within those pages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use specialized software:</strong> compare the evidence and find the discrepancies with the help of this unique program.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles:</strong> clearly someone wants to make things difficult for you, so use your wits and any hidden clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your choice:</strong> In the end, accuse someone. I hope it's the right choice for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240800/extras/619bb09fabea9e9bb28ae303af90f514.poster.avif?t=1779749095\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240800/extras/619bb09fabea9e9bb28ae303af90f514.webm?t=1779749095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have other applications and resources at your disposal, the most important being the girl's diary. It is important to compare the different media, as this will allow you to shed light on every secret of the characters and their connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will soon realize that this is not just a missing person case. Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ G.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240800/extras/5650be7f2eec427bd6cd88accb6c3150.avif?t=1779749095\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A movie shattered in pieces</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The complex story is told through Full Motion Video, with footage totaling over an hour. The fragmented nature of the investigation and the order in which you view it will influence your judgment. Will you be able to tell the truthful from the deceitful?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240800/extras/5d6d43086a7d74b6449164d94630a560.poster.avif?t=1779749095\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240800/extras/5d6d43086a7d74b6449164d94630a560.webm?t=1779749095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A plot rich in detail</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story delves deep into the characters' psyches, their truths hidden in the details and in the comparison of information; you won't find a sign with the solution... maybe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240800/extras/e0249122e8f406be2a07ed78ac269302.poster.avif?t=1779749095\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4240800/extras/e0249122e8f406be2a07ed78ac269302.webm?t=1779749095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles that will make you take notes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you really want to explore every dark corner of this story, be prepared to face various puzzles with a difficulty curve that will give you satisfaction, and have a notepad ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://